# A deliberately small profile: existing VT100 text behavior plus the
# implemented alternate-screen and cursor-visibility controls. No xterm,
# color, mouse, bracketed-paste or graphics compatibility claim.
tilminal|Tilminal VT100 text with alternate screen,
    smcup=\E[?1049h,
    rmcup=\E[?1049l,
    civis=\E[?25l,
    cnorm=\E[?25h,
    mc0@,
    mc4@,
    mc5@,
    mc5i@,
    use=vt100,
